{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46121","headline":"寿春节进大蜀皇帝五首 四 · 贯休","name":"寿春节进大蜀皇帝五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远人玉帛尽来归，及物天慈物物肥。\n春力遍时皆甲拆，王言闻者尽光辉。\n家家锦绣香醪熟，处处笙歌乳燕飞。\n爲报蜀皇勤祷祝，圣明天子古今稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}